# shell: desktop
# board: discover
# The board is found by its name on the bus, not by a port the harness
# hands over: the desktop scans, mounts what it finds, and the board's
# window comes up.  A native-USB console enumerates under its own name,
# which is what the scan matches.  The click brings that window to the
# front of the fixture's, as boarddraw does, before its title is asked.
wait 80
note the board found by scanning has its window on the desktop
click 558 174
wait 20
expect-title Board window
